cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use q2sl attest, please cite it as below."
title: "q2sl attest: QEC Syndrome Stabilizer Leakage"
abstract: >-
  Bounds what an observer can learn from the syndrome record of a stabilizer code: the distance between
  the syndrome distributions of two logical states under noise that is not Pauli, its order in the noise
  strength, the attack an observer of the records achieves, and estimates from measured records.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Nikolas
    family-names: Klein
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/NikoKleion/q2sl-Attest"
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - syndrome
  - side channel
  - amplitude damping
  - stabilizer codes
